{"ref":"BDB, צְפוֹ","hw":"צְפוֹ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צְפוֹ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צְפִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Σωφαρ: in Edom <strong>(</strong>? <em>gaze, gazing</em><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צְפוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:11\" href=\"/Genesis.36.11\">Gn 36:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:15\" href=\"/Genesis.36.15\">15</a> + v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:43\" href=\"/Genesis.36.43\">43</a> (ins. prob. after <span dir=\"rtl\">עירם</span>; cf. Lag<sup>Sept. Stud. ii. 10, 1, 178; 37, 1, 270</sup> Nes<sup>Mar. 12</sup>) = <span dir=\"rtl\">צְפִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.36\">1 Ch 1:36</a>.","next":"BDB, צְפוֹן","prev":"BDB, צָפָה³"}